<main id="text">
<h1 id="files">Files</h1>
<h2 id="reading">Reading</h2>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">use</span> std/sys
<span class="n">Print</span>(sys.<span class="f">Read</span>(<span class="s">&quot;notes.txt&quot;</span>).<span class="f">Value</span>)</code></pre>
<pre class="output"><code>first line
second line
</code></pre>
<p>Back to <a href="index.html">the start</a>.</p>
